<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Provisional machine alignment by Codex, English-first proposal; no human or semantic approval. Initial gcig is the contrastive Another within the continuing list of three parts; the later gcig is one. mi'i owns human with its genitive construction distributed in of the human; no detachable suffix is claimed. chur is the inflected water predicate at the third English water, after starts being; the first two glass of water references are translator expansions of de'i and remain unwrapped. The single byas pa selects the second provides following human, with shared predication also supplying the first provides. Other pronominal, case and connective contributions are omitted, not falsely nulled.</div>
